   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2023-06-21.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 140 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **mmj2023-06-21.flac16**: source not stated; 19 songs; 140 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper sat in the balcony, section 2LC, row V, seat 1, with mics roughly twelve feet high [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2023-06-21.flac24**: taped by bersey; transferred by bersey; source: CA-11 > CA-9100 > Sony PCM-M10 [1]. Also: Recorded with CA-11 cardioid mics into a CA-9100, then a Sony PCM-M10 at 24-bit/48kHz; Transfer chain: recorder to PC, Sound Forge for fades and normalizing, CD Wave Editor tracking, FLAC level 6 encoding, foobar tagging [1]\n- **mmj2023-06-21.flac16**: taped by bersey; transferred by bersey; source: CA-11 > CA-9100 > Sony PCM-M10 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [My Morning Jacket Riverside Theatre Milwaukee June 21 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/my-morning-jacket-riverside-theatre-milwaukee-june-21-2023-poster) [5]",
